{"repositoryId":1149070306,"availability":"available","full":"linggen/linggen","name":"linggen","description":"Local-first AI agent runtime for macOS — any model on your own machine, skills as files, your phone as a peer over WebRTC.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Rust","stars":11,"forks":2,"created":"2026-02-03T17:29:50Z","updated":"2026-10-19T12:30:13Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://linggen.dev","topics":["agent-runtime","agents","ai-agent","ai-assistant","llm","local-first","local-llm","macos","mcp","ollama","privacy","rust","self-hosted","webrtc"],"demo":"https://linggen.dev/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T13:44:21.147Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T13:44:21.147Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T13:44:21.147Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T15:00:52.299Z","stars":11,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-19T13:44:21.147Z","stars":11,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A personal CFO that reads your bank statements without uploading them, a Mac health doctor, a music DJ — full apps on one open runtime, with a general-purpose assistant built in.","CFO catches a $389 double charge (statements never leave your Mac) · Apple Shifu scores your Mac's health · DJ runs karaoke night. Full demo →","Architecturally, Linggen is the root system for AI agents. The core runtime manages agent processes, communication, and execution; everything else (skills, agents, missions) grows on top as files. An \"AI app\" in Linggen is a skill, an agent, or a mission — markdown + scripts, not code plugins. The runtime gives every app a process, syscalls (built-in tools), a filesystem (memory), permissions, and a network surface (P2P rooms)."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/linggen/linggen/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0391fd983e4f833578500c5dc1a3c5bb8e15cd6d2a5aafb53dc5734f618fd77f","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T15:00:52.609Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T